# Christmas party this weekend

  This weekend marks the end to a fabulous year of drumming and dancing for Rhythm Culture and we would love to share some final 2016 drumming vibes with you all before we head off to Woodford Folk Festival.  So, come join us @ The Lane Saturday December 17th for some awesome drumming and dancing vibes. There will be an open drum circle, Foli Kan performance and the Muso Foli Dance Troupe. Christmas Party! Saturday 17 December 3pm open drum circle 4pm Foli Kan and Muso Foli performance Stay on for the Christmas BBQ at Renae’s Pantry & party with us after ... Live tunes with The Moonsets (formerly The Flumes) on stage from 6pm $25 includes Starters & main $10 kids meals BYO drinks or buy yummy drinks from Renaes Pantry Bookings essential with Renae’s Pantry. Foli Kan students must book with Nathaniel in class.
